    <briefdescription>
<para>ISO 8601 / RFC 3339 timestamp parsing and formatting utilities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All methods operate on UTC time points. No external date/time library dependencies — only the C++ standard library is used.</para>
<para>Supported parse formats: &quot;2026-03-09T21:28:24Z&quot; &quot;2026-03-09T21:28:24.912Z&quot; &quot;2026-03-09T21:28:24+05:30&quot; &quot;2026-03-09T21:28:24.123+05:30&quot; </para>
    </detaileddescription>
